{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-10_beg","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-10","title":"“这种事”","storyCode":"6-11","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"9310624aa17357ec58d5c551d50402ef669d75c453849ba4dff4093a1039736f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"呜，呜......\n我肚子好饿！\n爸爸呢？爸爸去哪里了？\n没有爸爸不行......我要爸爸！爸爸！\n爸爸会来带我走的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"儿童？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"通报Blaze-4，Amiya-1小队，在贫民区四街十号建筑的废墟中发现幸存儿童，感染者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜，呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你，你是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是龙门人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......是不会伤害你的人。我乌萨斯话说得不好。我没敌意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我走，这里很乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔说待在这里，不可以动......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我可以带你去找爸爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"埋伏在我身后的人，出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是那些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......你是罗德岛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，退后点。别过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"放下武器，束手就擒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是来帮我们的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛！你知道有什么东西潜藏在这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我们好不容易设置好的埋伏......不引诱他们出来，不杀掉他们，我们就会被杀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"拿孩子做埋伏的诱饵，你们不如被杀算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在想什么？你以为我们被杀就了结了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我们被杀，他们也不会放过孩子，他们谁都不会放过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能这么简单就结束了，我们甘愿被杀也不会把孩子当做诱饵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我们甚至没有攻击你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"谁会这么做......你是说穿黑色雨披的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你见过他们了，你怎么会不明白！他们是要斩尽杀绝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是借口。等我制服你们以后，我会为你们申请保护。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"谁信你？！被你那弩箭射中，人都已经死了，还保护什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时保护你们的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"不要管了，先把她解决掉，我们重来一遍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"明明已经听见集合命令和撤退点了，要是就这样死在这里，我们怎么对得起为了保护孩子而死的他们的父母，他们可是我们的队友！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......孩子，躲远些！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我还活着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢，你觉得你死了会好点吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"煌干员？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你死了，这些事情也不会从大地上消失的。还是活着比较好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"那些......整合运动呢？那几个孩子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"干员灰喉，之前误解了你，很抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动我干掉了！孩子我藏起来了！你就不能好好听我说完！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"没必要......只要孩子安全就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......你真是不气别人一两下就不开心啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你误解我什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经看到你为了感染者孩子们奋勇作战的样子了。哗，好靓女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你龙门话讲得很烂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我就触景生情随便说的！我以前觉得你是个无血无泪的非感染者，加入罗德岛说不定是为了刺探情报，我误解你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我是间谍，我就会用这种手段让你信任我。只要你不是太傻让我流血致死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你帮我包扎了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我好歹是精英干员，这是我该做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的可能对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"但哪怕我知道你是间谍......你做了对的事，这点变不了。如果你是间谍，我会先救你，然后送你进法务处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我可能会逃走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"别老幻想些有的没的了。你怎么跑得过我呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"“信任”这个词儿，不意味着没有防范。信任是指，知道你会做什么事，不会做什么事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你做的对的，我全力支持；你做的错的，我要纠正，甚至阻止。这就是信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，灰喉，你信任了我，你用行动纠正了我的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我很抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"但你的劝说方式真的很烂。他们不是想要负隅顽抗，那是求生的表现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"如果造成了意外，你还是得进法务处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"那随你的便。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"还不错哦！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"她们之间关系，是不是缓和一点了？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"大概吧......至少煌这么尝试了。也就只有她能这么快放下成见去就事论事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的精英干员不只拥有出色的战斗能力。煌融入团体、和他人交流的主动性，也是非常专业的。只不过，她也有自己的立场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"想指挥好她，获取她的支持，就应该取得她的信任，更应该学会怎么去信任她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我和煌已经共同战斗了很长时间，我想......我想博士也可以试试。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我做的还行啊。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"应该......还不太够吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然表面上大大咧咧的，煌的内在其实可复杂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"再经过一些时间、经历一些事情，Dr.{@nickname}也是可以做到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但要再努力一点才行！"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"相互信任是困难的，但也是必须的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要博士的力量，而博士想要运用好自己的战术，就必须先被干员们认可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这是个漫长的过程，也是博士必须经历的过程。"}]},{"label":"那也得她配合才行。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"作为精英干员里最擅长攻坚战的那种，煌并不会在战术上提供太多思路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"她非常需要你的支持，不如说，只要你说，她就会履行你的战术。这是干员的专业性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这已经很配合了吧？"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"就像现在这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"干员们听从罗德岛一些合理的命令，往往是出于责任感，而不是信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"真正的信任是建立在理解上的，就像煌现在已经开始信任灰喉了一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎有整合运动的敌人在接近这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们就多给煌创造一点道歉的空间吧，在这种事上，她嘴还蛮笨的。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那就给她们多争取一点时间！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"原来她嘴笨的吗？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"就算擅长说话，也不就是擅长表达情感了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"其实煌也不是在花时间向灰喉道歉，不如说，她在对抗经验里自己对其他人的误解，甚至是一些根深蒂固的偏见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"并不只有普通人对感染者有偏见......感染者对普通人也有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"内在的敌人和外在的敌人，都是敌人。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们会战胜所有敌人。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才那些整合运动的眼神里充满了恐惧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们和近卫局没可能把人吓成这样，别说逼他们不顾一切地打破自己原本的坚持了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他们遭遇了什么样的敌人......究竟是什么让他们变成这个样子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......会和那些人为敌吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["？？？","煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_367_swllow","aliases":["灰喉"]}]}
